abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived result tables for the shared hub-gene and
  immune-signature study of sepsis and ARDS, covering bulk transcriptomic
  discovery and external validation, machine learning with SHAP, Mendelian
  randomization, colocalization, SMR-HEIDI, immune deconvolution, GSVA/GSEA,
  single-cell annotation and communication, virtual knockout, survival
  modelling, protein-level validation and molecular docking. The repository
  ships the frozen result tables needed to redraw main Figures 1-10 and
  Supplementary Figures S1-S27 in four formats, together with the scripts that
  regenerate them. Raw inputs are public third-party resources and are not
  redistributed; accessions and versions are listed in the manuscript's data
  availability statement.
keywords:
  - sepsis
  - ARDS
  - transcriptomics
